<h3>2. Items based on our production experience (LPC-LL-003)</h3>
<p>These proposals are not limits of our capability document but lessons from=
 earlier fibre-array products:</p>
<ul><li><b>Item 6 (Borosilicate lid on fused-silica substrate)</b>: LPC-LL-00=
3 LL-01: IL increase up to 0.35 dB on 4 of 11 pcs after 700 of 1000 thermal c=
ycles. CTE mismatch: fused-silica lid (0.55 ppm/K) on borosilicate substrate =
(3.3 ppm/K) shears the epoxy bond line. Design rule DR-01: Use the same glass=
 for lid and substrate (CTE match) when thermal cycling beyond 500 cycles or =
an extended temperature range is required.</li></ul>

